  "description": "This build requires very high macro apm, so do not expect to be able to pull it off first try. It is susceptible to dark age rushes and early pressure. To counteract this, try and keep the opponent pinned down with those feudal sofa. This strategy carried me to Diamond 1 and I'm still climbing with it. GL and have a good time with this one.",
